A classical apartment building under renovation, its whole front covered by scaffolding with a giant landscape advertising mesh banner as the chroma screen; street with parked cars and a cyclist below, cloudy sky.

Photorealistic documentary street photograph, shot on a full-frame DSLR, natural colours, slight grain, realistic everyday people. Scandinavian city (Copenhagen-like architecture: brick facades, copper roofs, cyclists) but no real, identifiable landmark and no readable shop signs or brand logos anywhere. IMPORTANT: every advertising surface in the scene is a blank chroma-key screen: the whole display area is filled edge to edge with flat, uniform, pure chroma green (#00FF00), no text, no image, no logo, no pattern, crisp straight edges with its real frame/bezel around it. Nothing else in the image is green of that hue.